    "created_at": "2016-05-13T00:06:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-13T00:06:34Z",
    "body": "It seems I approved the TEXTAREA changes without checking the specification.  I'm sorry for that!\n\nIMO, cloning no TEXTAREA value is very inconsistent with cloning INPUT value, and cloning TEXTAREA  value will help web authors.  We should have cloning steps for all of stateful form controls.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
