    "created_at": "2016-09-14T18:26:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-14T18:26:22Z",
    "body": "Maybe one reason why it might be weird to copy the raw value while cloning is that that de-synchronizes the DOM tree from the raw value. That is, it makes it possible to have a textarea with no children, but with a raw value. I don't think it's possible to have that scenario otherwise.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
