    "created_at": "2016-09-15T08:18:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-15T08:18:50Z",
    "body": "I agree with @tkent-google that we should just make `textarea` consistent with `input`, even though I kinda dislike special cloning behavior. It also seems neither WebKit nor Gecko folks are opposed.\n",
